)∧P1' ↦ next_belief∈AStepPossible(P1,current_belief_base,action_library,plan_library)∧next_intention=Declarative_goal_intention(s,Try_current_with_backups(P1,P2),f)) ∣ next_intention ↦ next_belief}"/>
